@startuml
' Figure 31.4  Policy bundle versioning
' Reading order: top to bottom. A bundle is proposed by its author,
' signed by someone else, runs in shadow beside the active bundle,
' becomes active, and is superseded; a revoked policy version stops its
' unspent permissions. From policy.bundle.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
hide empty description
[*] -down-> Draft : Author proposes
Draft -down-> Signed : Other person signs
Signed -right-> Shadow : Beside active
Shadow -down-> Active : Differences reviewed
Active -down-> Superseded : Next bundle active
Active -right-> Revoked : Version revoked
Superseded --> [*]
@enduml
